      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.53,
      "end_seconds": 134.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.0,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.72,
      "end_seconds": 138.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.89,
      "end_seconds": 162.41,
      "duration_seconds": 7.52,
      "text": "There is a curve in the upper back and you are three centimetres shorter than before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.28,
      "end_seconds": 172.48,
      "duration_seconds": 6.2,
      "text": "You can relax now. And what about numbness, weight loss, bladder problems or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.32,
      "end_seconds": 181.23,
      "duration_seconds": 6.91,
      "text": "no, uh, no numbness, weight loss, bladder problems or fever"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.71,
      "end_seconds": 185.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.07,
      "end_seconds": 191.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Let me think, no, skin's been fine."
